{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/ae04952f202e138a2683301c92df71ba.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fate of the <i>Erebus</i> and its crew through corrupted logs, radio transmissions, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/129eb23074625c7615a8e9724b97e23f.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting, sound design, and environmental detail create a hauntingly believable sci-fi setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/f133d6816cf622639eb566e02614500c.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>Reality bends the deeper you go. Hallways change, voices echo back wrong, and familiar faces twist into something alien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/41f44b0a7b97f1ecd0b73e58eedcf1e9.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>voice acting that brings Commander Elara Voss and Ryder\u2019s story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/bf9e0b21a82e6f18f30a9bd46fce18b7.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>Experience story-driven cut scenes, reactive environments, and a minimalist UI that keeps you grounded in the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/f7685416487454a5e0585a0fc3d00ed3.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>Short, re playable, and perfect for atmospheric playthroughs\u00a0 with secrets hidden for those who look closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Void Is Never Silent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADRIFT is a standalone short horror experience\u00a0 a love letter to classic sci-fi horror like <i>Alien</i>, <i>Event Horizon</i>, and <i>Dead Space</i>, told through the lens of isolation, communication, and identity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4153510?t=1763938461","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4153510?t=1763938461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/2df98ebadfcb2a8e0499ba7bf2759b90c18a49d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763938461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/2df98ebadfcb2a8e0499ba7bf2759b90c18a49d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763938461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/ae04952f202e138a2683301c92df71ba.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fate of the <i>Erebus</i> and its crew through corrupted logs, radio transmissions, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/129eb23074625c7615a8e9724b97e23f.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting, sound design, and environmental detail create a hauntingly believable sci-fi setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/f133d6816cf622639eb566e02614500c.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>Reality bends the deeper you go. Hallways change, voices echo back wrong, and familiar faces twist into something alien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/41f44b0a7b97f1ecd0b73e58eedcf1e9.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>voice acting that brings Commander Elara Voss and Ryder\u2019s story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/bf9e0b21a82e6f18f30a9bd46fce18b7.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>Experience story-driven cut scenes, reactive environments, and a minimalist UI that keeps you grounded in the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/extras/f7685416487454a5e0585a0fc3d00ed3.avif?t=1763938461\" width=1536 height=100 /></span>Short, re playable, and perfect for atmospheric playthroughs\u00a0 with secrets hidden for those who look closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Void Is Never Silent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ADRIFT is a standalone short horror experience\u00a0 a love letter to classic sci-fi horror like <i>Alien</i>, <i>Event Horizon</i>, and <i>Dead Space</i>, told through the lens of isolation, communication, and identity.</p>","developers":["Ciaran Thistle"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153510/fee326c68cf018cd0f51d5e4bb404cb844910d23/header.jpg?t=1763938461","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153510/2006179281/cbd7a595b9d653b2adad0760963a34e6dd726a45/1762805880/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762806801","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153510/2006179281/cbd7a595b9d653b2adad0760963a34e6dd726a45/1762805880/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762806801","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153510/2006179281/cbd7a595b9d653b2adad0760963a34e6dd726a45/1762805880/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762806801","id":257225512,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225512/cfe37bd7ea4f035d02a01af3d658702f0d7d7167/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762806801"}],"name":"Adrift","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHZ | Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB +<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHZ | Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gr